mber Alumbrados '']","commission":"DMC dining add-ons / hotel F&B / activity affiliate","accessed":"2026-07-07"},{"name":"Feria de las Flores — silleteros (Jul 31–Aug 9, 2026)","si_tag":"RHN/CHER","tier":"comfort","source":"https://medellingroup.com/blog/feria-de-las-flores-2026-complete-guide-to-medellins-flower-festival (Accessed 2026-07-07)","timing":"[''December–March '', ''July–August '', ''Feria de las Flores late-Jul→Aug 9 '', ''December Alumbrados '']","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"The flower festival and its 530-silletero parade — the city''s headline peak; grandstand + curated hotel packages","si":"RHN/CHER","blurb":"The flower festival and its 530-silletero parade — the city''s headline peak; grandstand + curated hotel packages","when":"[''December–March '', ''July–August '', ''Feria de las Flores late-Jul→Aug 9 '', ''December Alumbrados '']","commission":"DMC festival packages + hotel/villa MoR","accessed":"2026-07-07"}],"faq":[{"q":"Is Medellín a good place for a couples trip or honeymoon?","a":"Yes — for couples arriving together. El Poblado luxury apartments, rooftop-pool hotels and coffee-finca escapes are genuinely romantic. The plain caveat: the US Embassy links 8 suspicious US-citizen deaths in Medellín (Nov–Dec 2023) to dating-app-lured druggings, so the safe lane is partners who arrive together, not app meet-ups.","source":"co.usembassy.gov, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"romance"},{"q":"What is Comuna 13 and is it worth visiting?","a":"Yes — Comuna 13 is Medellín''s most-visited site and the emblem of its turnaround. Outdoor public escalators installed in 2011 cut a 35-minute climb to 6 minutes; today the hillside barrio is a canvas of community murals, told on a guided walking tour (~$20–30). Go guided, daytime, as a group.","source":"machupicchu.org, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"culture"},{"q":"How do you visit Guatapé and El Peñol rock from Medellín?","a":"Guatapé sits about 2 hours east, usually as a full-day trip. The headline is climbing El Peñol (Piedra del Peñol) via 740 steps — most reach the top in 15–25 minutes — over a reservoir dotted with islands, then wandering the brightly painted zócalo streets. Book a day-trip operator or DMC.","source":"en.wikipedia.org, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"adventure"},{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for in Medellín?","a":"The signature Medellín danger is dating-app drugging-and-robbery, not the headlines. The US Embassy is aware of 8 suspicious US-citizen deaths (Nov 1–Dec 31, 2023) involving scopolamine (\"burundanga\") — odorless, memory-erasing and lethal in large doses. Don''t meet app strangers alone, never leave a drink unattended, and meet only in public.","source":"co.usembassy.gov, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"Is climbing El Peñol''s 740 steps dangerous?","a":"It''s a steep but manageable self-guided climb — 740 steps, 15–25 minutes for most — though not for those with cardiac or mobility limits. Pace it, hydrate, and mind your footing on the descent. Paragliding over the Aburrá Valley, by contrast, should be flown only with certified, insured, safety-vetted operators.","source":"en.wikipedia.org, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"safety"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Medellín & Antioquia Travel Guide 2026 — Comuna 13, Guatapé, Coffee Country | TravelWell","jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","search_language":"es-CO","local_keywords":["qué hacer en Medellín","Comuna 13 tour","Guatapé Peñol","Feria de las Flores","dónde hospedarse en Medellín","seguridad Medellín aplicaciones de citas"],"hreflang":["en","es-CO"],"author_byline":"By David McCallister — commercial pilot, 56 countries","freshness":"2026-07-07","primary_keyword":"Medellín & Antioquia"},"booking":null,"si_checklist_25":null,"sis_present":[{"si":"culture","status":"live"}],"ultra":[{"name":"The Charlee","location":"El Poblado","note":"Envy rooftop pool/bar, 360° valley views; most-photographed hotel in Colombia","program":"MoR / consortia where preferred","price_ti